# Introduction

Welcome to the Nusii API! You can use our API to access Nusii API endpoints. All endpoint URLs begin with `https://app.nusii.com/api/v2/`. All requests must be serialized in JSON and Nusii uses the [jsonapi.org](http://jsonapi.org/) specification.

## OpenAPI Specification

The complete API surface is available as a machine-readable [OpenAPI 3.1 specification (YAML)](openapi/v2.yaml), also served by the API itself at `https://app.nusii.com/api/v2/openapi.yaml`. It is generated from Nusii's test suite on every API change, so it always describes what the API actually returns. Keep a copy in your repository and diff it against new versions to spot changes — including breaking ones — before they reach your integration.

